  "text": "Elections - Currituck County\nResidents\nResidents\nCurrituck County Residents are welcome to browse popular services and departments throughout the County.\nNews You Can Use\nPress Releases\nFocus on Currituck Newsletter\nStrategic Plan\nBeach Management\nQuarter-Cent Sales Tax Referendum\nElection District Referendum\nPopular Services\nPay a utility bill\nPay a tax bill\nGet a parking pass\nGet a building permit\nGet a marriage certificate\nSee all Services\nPopular Departments\nEmergency Management\nParks & Recreation\nTaxes & Property\nPublic Works\nLibrary\nView all\nBusinesses\nBusinesses\nCurrent and prospective business owners can easily find the top relevant pages for Currituck County.\nPopular Services\nGet a building permit\nRequest a Business Re-Entry Permit\nLearn about planning, permitting, and inspections\nGIS Interactive Map\nLearn more about the Airport\nView all\nPopular Departments\nAirport\nFinance\nPlanning & Inspections\nTax\nBids & RFPs\nView all\nVisitors\nVisitors\nCurrituck County is known for its picturesque beaches, maritime history and majestic wild horses. Click the link to learn more about planning your next vacation to Corolla and Currituck County.\nVisit The Northern Outer Banks\nGovernment\nGeneral\nMinutes & Agendas\nPublic Notices\nBIDS & RFPs\nCurrituck Access Permit\nCourts\nLocal Laws\nBoards, Committees, & Staff\nBoard of commissioners\nCounty Attorney\nCounty manager\nEmployee Resources\nStaff Directory\nDepartments\nDepartment Directory\n\u00d7\nThe Official Site For\nCurrituck County\nMenu\nThe Official Site For\nCurrituck County\nNews\nEvent Calendar\nContact Us\nFor Employees\nJobs\nResidents\nResidents\nCurrituck County Residents are welcome to browse popular services and departments throughout the County.\nNews You Can Use\nPress Releases\nFocus on Currituck Newsletter\nStrategic Plan\nBeach Management\nQuarter-Cent Sales Tax Referendum\nElection District Referendum\nPopular Services\nPay a utility bill\nPay a tax bill\nGet a parking pass\nGet a building permit\nGet a marriage certificate\nSee all Services\nPopular Departments\nEmergency Management\nParks & Recreation\nTaxes & Property\nPublic Works\nLibrary\nView all\nBusinesses\nBusinesses\nCurrent and prospective business owners can easily find the top relevant pages for Currituck County.\nPopular Services\nGet a building permit\nRequest a Business Re-Entry Permit\nLearn about planning, permitting, and inspections\nGIS Interactive Map\nLearn more about the Airport\nView all\nPopular Departments\nAirport\nFinance\nPlanning & Inspections\nTax\nBids & RFPs\nView all\nVisitors\nVisitors\nCurrituck County is known for its picturesque beaches, maritime history and majestic wild horses. Click the link to learn more about planning your next vacation to Corolla and Currituck County.\nVisit The Northern Outer Banks\nGovernment\nGeneral\nMinutes & Agendas\nPublic Notices\nBIDS & RFPs\nCurrituck Access Permit\nCourts\nLocal Laws\nBoards, Committees, & Staff\nBoard of commissioners\nCounty Attorney\nCounty manager\nEmployee Resources\nStaff Directory\nDepartments\nDepartment Directory\nElections\nHome\nElections\nElections\nBecome a Poll Worker\nPhoto ID Requirement\nOnline Voter Registration\nVoter Registration (PDF)\nVote By Mail\nNC Political Parties\n2026 Candidates List\nElection Results\nElection Security\nElectoral College\nTypes of Elections\nPrecincts & Polling Places\nState Voter Tools & Forms\nCandidate Resources\nCandidate Campaign Reports\nCampaign Finance\nElections Board\nQuestions & Answers\nAbout Us\nStaff\nContact Information\nElizabeth Gettens\nBoard of Elections Director\nVacant\nDeputy Director\nPhone: 252-232-2525\nFax: 252-584-2642\nMailing Address:\nP.O. Box 177\nCurrituck, North Carolina 27929\nPhysical Address:\n2795 Caratoke Highway\nCurrituck, North Carolina 27929\nHours:\nMonday - Friday\n8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m.\nCurrituck County Voter Statistics | October 5, 2026\nDemocratic\n3,064\nGreen\n8\nLibertarian\n203\nRepublican\n10,902\nUnaffiliated\n11,008\nTotal\n25,185\n2026 Elections Information\nElection Day: Tuesday, November 3, 2026\n2026 Official North Carolina Contest and Referendum Information\nCurrituck County Official Election Notice \u2013 August 2026 (PDF)\nNotice of General Election\nEarly Voting Schedule\nEarly voting will be held at:\n2801 Caratoke Highway\nCurrituck County Judicial Building\nCourtroom C\nCurrituck, North Carolina\nThursday, October 15 & Friday, October 16, 2026\n8:00 a. m. \u2013 5:00 p.m.\nMonday, October 19, 2026 \u2013 Friday, October 23, 2026\n8:00 a.m. \u2013 5:00 p.m.\nMonday, October 26, 2026 \u2013 Friday, October 30, 2026\n8:00 a.m. \u2013 5:00 p.m.\nSaturday, October 31, 2026\n8:00 a.m. \u2013 3:00.p.m.\nAbsentee Voting\nTuesday, October 20, 2026\nis the\ndeadline\nto submit a request for an Absentee Ballot by Mail.\n(Military and Overseas Voters \u2013 the request deadline is Monday, November 2, 2026)\nAbsentee Ballots by Mail can be returned to the Currituck County Board of Elections office via mail or in-person.\nAbsentee Ballots can also be submitted during Early Voting at the county Early Voting site.\nTuesday, November 3, 2026\n, by 7:30 p.m., is the\nreturn deadline\nfor all Absentee Ballots.\nSchedule of Upcoming Board of Elections General Business Meetings\nAll Board of Elections meetings scheduled will be held on the second Tuesday\u2019s of each month at the Board of Election\u2019s Office at 10:00 a.m. Any other business transacted by the Board will be done at this time.\nJanuary 13, 2026\nJanuary 20, 2026 | Special Meeting | Logic and Accuracy Testing (L&A)\nJanuary 27, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #1\nFebruary 3, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #2 \u2013\nCANCELLED\nFebruary 10, 2026\nFebruary 10, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #3\nFebruary 17, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #4\nFebruary 24, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #5\nMarch 2, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #6\nMarch 6, 2026 \u2013 12:00 p.m. | Special Meeting | Provisional Ballot Count\nMarch 10, 2026 \u2013\nCANCELLED\nMarch 13, 2026 \u2013 11:00 a.m. | County Canvass Board Meeting\nApril 14, 2026\nMay 12, 2026\nJune 9, 2026\nJuly 14, 2026\nAugust 11, 2026 \u2013\nCANCELLED\nSeptember 8, 2026\nSeptember 16, 2026 | 9:00 a.m. | Special Meeting | Logic and Accuracy Testing\nSeptember 16, 2026 | 9:00 a.m. | Special Meeting |\nAcceptance Testing\nSeptember 29, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #1\nOctober 6, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #2\nOctober 13, 2026\nOctober 13, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #3\nOctober 20, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #4\nOctober 27, 2026 | Special Meeting | Board Meeting-Absentee #5\nNovember 2, 2026 | 5:00 p.m. | Special Meeting | Absentee Board Meeting (Pre-Election Day)\nNovember 10, 2026\nNovember 10, 2026 | 12:30 p.m. | Special Meeting | Provisional Ballot Count\nNovember 13, 2026 |11:00 a.m. | Special Meeting | County Canvass\nDecember 8, 2026\nThe Official Site For\nCurrituck County\nAddress\n153 Courthouse Road\nCurrituck, NC\nUnited States\nEmail\nEmail Us >\n[email protected]\nHours\nMonday to Friday 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nCurrituck Alert\nRegister today and receive emergency notifications as well as notifications to let you know of important public meetings and community events.\nSignup Today\nNavigation\nDepartment Directory\nServices Directory\nStaff Directory\nNews\nEvent Calendar\nContact Us\nJobs\nFor Employee\nPrivacy Policy\nSocial media\nFacebook\nTwitter\nYoutube\n@2024 Currituck County\nPrivacy Policy\nDisclaimer\n\u00a92017 Currituck County\nSearch for:\nSearch Button",
